            Hospitals &amp; Networks
          </div>
          <div class="hc-logo-badge">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0D9488" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"></path></svg>
            Specialist Clinics
          </div>
          <div class="hc-logo-badge">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2563EB" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2v20M2 12h20"></path></svg>
            Health-Tech Startups
          </div>
          <div class="hc-logo-badge">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0D9488" stroke-width="2"><path d="M10 2v7.31L4.75 18.1A2 2 0 0 0 6.47 21h11.06a2 2 0 0 0 1.72-2.9L14 9.31V2z"></path></svg>
            Diagnostic Laboratories
          </div>
          <div class="hc-logo-badge">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2563EB" stroke-width="2"><path d="M10.5 20.4l-7.9-7.9a5.1 5.1 0 0 1 7.2-7.2l7.9 7.9a5.1 5.1 0 0 1-7.2 7.2z"></path></svg>
            Pharmacy Chains
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hc-trust-strip__pillars">
          <div class="hc-trust-pillar">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>
            <span>Secure Architecture</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hc-trust-pillar">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 10h-4V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6H2a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6h4a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"></path></svg>
            <span>Scalable Infrastructure</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hc-trust-pillar">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M16 16v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path><path d="M18 8h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-4"></path><circle cx="8" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg>
            <span>Interoperable Systems</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hc-trust-pillar">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"></path></svg>
            <span>Patient-Centric Design</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════
         3. PROBLEM SECTION
    ═══════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <section class="hc-section hc-section--light">
      <div class="container">
        
        <div class="hc-section-head text-center">
          <span class="hc-sub-title">THE CHALLENGE</span>
          <h2 class="hc-section-title">
            Healthcare is complex. Your software shouldn't be.
          </h2>
          <p class="hc-section-desc">
            Disconnected systems, manual processes, fragmented patient data, and outdated workflows can slow down healthcare organizations. We simplify that complexity with software designed specifically around the way your teams work.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="hc-problem-grid">
          
          <div class="hc-problem-card">
            <div class="hc-problem-card__number">01</div>
            <div class="hc-problem-card__icon">
              <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M16 16v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path><path d="M18 8h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-4"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="hc-problem-card__title">Fragmented Systems</h3>
            <p class="hc-problem-card__desc">
              Connect disconnected healthcare platforms, legacy EMRs, labs, and third-party data sources into one synchronized ecosystem.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="hc-problem-card">
            <div class="hc-problem-card__number">02</div>
            <div class="hc-problem-card__icon">
              <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"></line><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"></line></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="hc-problem-card__title">Manual Workflows</h3>
            <p class="hc-problem-card__desc">
              Automate repetitive administrative and clinical operational processes to eliminate human error and reduce staff burnout.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="hc-problem-card">
            <div class="hc-problem-card__number">03</div>
            <div class="hc-problem-card__icon">
              <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="hc-problem-card__title">Poor Patient Experience</h3>
            <p class="hc-problem-card__desc">
              Create simpler, more intuitive digital journeys for scheduling, telehealth, medical history access, and bill payment.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="hc-problem-card">
            <div class="hc-problem-card__number">04</div>
            <div class="hc-problem-card__icon">
              <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"></line><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"></line><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"></line></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="hc-problem-card__title">Limited Visibility</h3>
            <p class="hc-problem-card__desc">
              Turn healthcare data into actionable insights through intelligent real-time executive dashboards and clinical analytics.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════
         4. SOLUTIONS SECTION
    ═══════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <section id="solutions" class="hc-section">
      <div class="container">

        <div class="hc-section-head text-center">
          <span class="hc-sub-title">SOLUTIONS ARCHITECTURE</span>
          <h2 class="hc-section-title">
            Solutions for every stage of the healthcare journey.
          </h2>
          <p class="hc-section-desc">
            From clinical operations to patient engagement, we create connected digital solutions that solve real healthcare challenges.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="hc-solutions-grid">
          
          <!-- Solution Card 01 -->
          <div class="hc-solution-card">
