              </div>
              <span class="hc-solution-card__idx">01</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="hc-solution-card__title">EHR / EMR Solutions</h3>
            <p class="hc-solution-card__desc">
              Secure and intuitive electronic health record systems designed around clinical workflows, rapid chart entry, and FHIR standards.
            </p>
            <a href="#contact-form" class="hc-solution-card__link">
              Learn More <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Solution Card 02 -->
          <div class="hc-solution-card">
            <div class="hc-solution-card__head">
              <div class="hc-solution-card__icon">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"></path><path d="M1 21h22"></path><path d="M9 7h1"></path><path d="M9 11h1"></path><path d="M14 7h1"></path><path d="M14 11h1"></path></svg>
              </div>
              <span class="hc-solution-card__idx">02</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="hc-solution-card__title">Hospital Management Software</h3>
            <p class="hc-solution-card__desc">
              Centralize operations, bed capacity, resources, appointments, billing, departments, and patient information across facilities.
            </p>
            <a href="#contact-form" class="hc-solution-card__link">
              Learn More <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Solution Card 03 -->
          <div class="hc-solution-card">
            <div class="hc-solution-card__head">
              <div class="hc-solution-card__icon">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polygon points="23 7 16 12 23 17 23 7"></polygon><rect x="1" y="5" width="15" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect></svg>
              </div>
              <span class="hc-solution-card__idx">03</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="hc-solution-card__title">Telemedicine Platforms</h3>
            <p class="hc-solution-card__desc">
              Enable secure virtual consultations, remote care, scheduling, multi-party video consultations, and digital follow-ups.
            </p>
            <a href="#contact-form" class="hc-solution-card__link">
              Learn More <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
